AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000124> "The relation between a data item and a conclusion where the conclusion is the output of a data interpreting process and the data item is used as an input to that process"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000124> "is_supported_by_data")
