AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002352> "inverse of has input")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002352> "input of"@en)
