# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002501> (causal relation between processes)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002501> "p is causally related to q if and only if p or any part of p and q or any part of q are linked by a chain of events where each event pair is one where the execution of p influences the execution of q. p may be upstream, downstream, part of, or a container of q.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002501> "causal relation between processes")
