AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000009> "datum label"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000009> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030>)

