AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000704> "A decision tree induction objective is a data transformation objective in which a tree-like graph of edges and nodes is created and from which the selection of each branch requires that some type of logical decision is made."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000704> "decision tree induction objective")
