AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0002317> "A clinical tumor stage group according to AJCC 7th edition indicating cancers that are smaller or less deeply invasive without regional disease or nodes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0002317> "Stage I (AJCC 7th)")
ClassAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0002314> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0002317>)

