AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0002327> "An International Federation of Gynecology and Obstetrics cervical cancer stage value specification indicating invasive carcinoma which can be diagnosed only by microscopy, with deepest invasion <5 mm and the largest extension <7 mm."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0002327> "Stage IA (FIGO)")
ClassAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0002326> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0002327>)

